[en.FOCUS_C12_IN_CHARGE]
in charge

[en.FOCUS_C12_IN_CHARGE_desc]
Only when the name of Limestone Pie and that of the Pie family are indelibly etched in the heart of every pony will I—we, the Pie family—truly become the sole and eternal rulers of this land. Next, a series of my grand ambitions will unfold naturally, and the Empire is about to meet its doom.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IN_CHARGE]
大权在握

[zh.FOCUS_C12_IN_CHARGE_desc]
只有当石青派和派家族的名字深深烙印在每一匹小马的心中，我，我们派家族，才真正意义上成为这块土地上唯一且永恒的统治者。接下来，我一系列雄伟的抱负将顺理成章的开展，而帝国即将迎来他们的末日

